{
  "name": "living-yua",
  "description": "Install YUA plus the living-world patch on the QA profile, prove both plugins load and both YUA/Mira materialize in the Bannered Mare, then pause for dialogue and follower-ownership checks.",
  "baseline": "Save3_474D5830_0_507269736F6E6572_Tamriel_000008_20260802003106_1_1",
  "defaults": {
    "settle_seconds": 8,
    "assert_retry_seconds": 30
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "kill",
      "mo2": true,
      "label": "start from a clean Skyrim and MO2 session"
    },
    {
      "type": "install",
      "source": "/home/lorkhan/skyrim_mods/hdd/YUA Follower ESL.7z",
      "mod_name": "QA YUA Follower ESL"
    },
    {
      "type": "install",
      "source": "/home/lorkhan/skyrim_mods/mine/MFLivingYUA.zip",
      "mod_name": "QA MFLivingYUA"
    },
    {
      "type": "launch",
      "wait": 240
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "the engine loaded YUA",
      "include": [
        "plugins"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "plugins[*].name": {
          "eq": "YUA_Follower.esp"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "the engine loaded the living-world patch",
      "include": [
        "plugins"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "plugins[*].name": {
          "eq": "MFLivingYUA.esp"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "load_baseline"
    },
    {
      "type": "console",
      "cmd": "coc WhiterunBanneredMare",
      "settle": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "YUA materialized in the Bannered Mare",
      "include": [
        "nearby_actors"
      ],
      "radius": 4096,
      "expect": {
        "player.cell_form_id": {
          "eq": 90206
        },
        "player.interior": true,
        "nearby_actors[*].name": {
          "eq": "YUA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assert_state",
      "label": "Mira is present as the rumor speaker",
      "include": [
        "nearby_actors"
      ],
      "radius": 4096,
      "expect": {
        "nearby_actors[*].name": {
          "eq": "Mira Snow-Voice"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "console",
      "cmd": "set MFLiving_N0_Deeds to 3",
      "settle": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "handoff_user",
      "message": "請驗收 YUA 的 off-screen handoff：1) 招募 YUA，`coc RiverwoodSleepingGiantInn`，等 3 遊戲時，確認她仍跟著且 `getglobalvalue MFLiving_N0_Deeds` 仍為 3；2) 在 Sleeping Giant Inn dismiss，留在她附近或跟著她走至少 10 秒——她應沿用原 follower 回家行為自然走開，不能在眼前瞬間消失；3) 等你與她不再同一 cell 後，`coc WhiterunBanneredMare` 並等 6 秒，她應在 Bannered Mare 重新出現。完成按 Enter；任何異常請輸入現象再按 Enter。",
      "expect": "teammate ownership is respected; dismissal stays visible while co-located; off-screen transition resumes living-world control"
    }
  ],
  "teardown": [
    {
      "type": "kill",
      "mo2": true
    },
    {
      "type": "uninstall",
      "mod_name": "QA MFLivingYUA"
    },
    {
      "type": "uninstall",
      "mod_name": "QA YUA Follower ESL"
    }
  ]
}
